{"id": "e24c0951-ab5c-4a05-a812-e3469821b369", "slug": "nexus-autonomous-scaling-infrastructure", "title": "Nexus - Autonomous Scaling Infrastructure", "description": "Nexus Autonomous Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus - Autonomous Scaling Infrastructure\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Autonomous Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#EDEDED\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#EDEDED\"\n  background: \"#080808\"\n  surface: \"#EDEDED\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"24px\"\n  control: \"24px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus - Autonomous Scaling Infrastructure\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 42; favorites: 16; remixes: 1.\nTags: pricing, section, animated, cta, billing.\n## Overview\nNexus Autonomous Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nAxiom Ecosystem Architecture Enterprise Docs Pricing Request Tokens Adaptive Architecture For Self-Governing Compute Empower your technical teams with a centralized command center to deploy, monitor, and elastically sca…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Adaptive Architecture For Self-Governing Compute.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #EDEDED, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #EDEDED, background #080808, surface #EDEDED, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Geist for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus - Autonomous Scaling Infrastructure</title>\n\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#080808] text-[#EDEDED] font-light antialiased relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#EDEDED]/30 selection:text-white\" style=\"background-color: #080808; font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Global Noise Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-[9999]\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.65%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22 opacity=%221%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E'); opacity: 0.015; mix-blend-mode: overlay;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Framed Layout Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-[1400px] min-h-screen flex flex-col border-x border-neutral-800 bg-[#080808]\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(237,237,237,0.01) 0, rgba(237,237,237,0.01) 1px, transparent 0, transparent 32px);\">\n\n        <!-- Corner Brackets -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-6 h-6 border-t border-l border-neutral-800 z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-6 h-6 border-t border-r border-neutral-800 z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-6 h-6 border-b border-l border-neutral-800 z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-6 h-6 border-b border-r border-neutral-800 z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"relative flex justify-between items-center px-6 lg:px-12 py-6 border-b border-neutral-800 bg-[#080808]/80 backdrop-blur-md z-50\">\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-pointer\">\n                <div class=\"relative p-[1px] group flashlight-module rounded-[24px] bg-neutral-800\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] blur-[12px] rounded-[24px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] rounded-[24px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative bg-[#080808] rounded-[23px] w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" class=\"text-[#EDEDED] text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-lg font-light tracking-tight text-[#EDEDED]\">Axiom</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Nav -->\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 tracking-tight\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#EDEDED] transition-colors duration-300\">Ecosystem</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#EDEDED] transition-colors duration-300\">Architecture</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#EDEDED] transition-colors duration-300\">Enterprise</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#EDEDED] transition-colors duration-300\">Docs</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#EDEDED] transition-colors duration-300\">Pricing</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- CTA -->\n            <div class=\"hidden sm:block relative p-[1px] group flashlight-module rounded-[24px] bg-neutral-800 cursor-pointer\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] blur-[12px] rounded-[24px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] rounded-[24px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                <div class=\"relative bg-[#080808] group-hover:bg-[#121212] rounded-[23px] px-5 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-light text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight\">Request Tokens</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-[#EDEDED]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Content -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col lg:flex-row relative z-0\">\n\n            <!-- Center dividing line -->\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-1/2 w-px bg-neutral-800 -translate-x-1/2\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Left Column: Copy & Actions -->\n            <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center px-6 lg:px-16 py-16 lg:py-24 relative\">\n\n                <!-- Crosshairs styling element -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 -left-2 w-4 h-px bg-neutral-800\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 -left-2 w-px h-4 bg-neutral-800 -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-2\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"max-w-xl\">\n                    <!-- Masked Reveal Heading -->\n                    <h1 id=\"hero-heading\" class=\"text-4xl lg:text-6xl leading-[1.1] tracking-tight font-light text-[#EDEDED] mb-6\">\n                        Adaptive Architecture For Self-Governing Compute\n                    </h1>\n\n                    <p id=\"hero-subheading\" class=\"text-base text-[#EDEDED]/70 mb-10 leading-relaxed font-light tracking-tight max-w-md opacity-0\">\n                        Empower your technical teams with a centralized command center to deploy, monitor, and elastically scale resources with absolute certainty.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <div id=\"hero-buttons\" class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5 mb-20 opacity-0\">\n                        <!-- Primary Button -->\n                        <button class=\"relative p-[1px] group flashlight-module rounded-[24px] bg-neutral-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#EDEDED]/50 text-left cursor-pointer\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] blur-[12px] rounded-[24px] pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] rounded-[24px] pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"relative bg-[#080808] group-hover:bg-[#121212] rounded-[23px] px-6 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                                <span class=\"text-sm font-light text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight\">Initialize Grid</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rocket-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-[#EDEDED]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- Secondary Button -->\n                        <button class=\"relative p-[1px] group flashlight-module rounded-[24px] bg-neutral-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#EDEDED]/50 text-left cursor-pointer\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] blur-[12px] rounded-[24px] pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] rounded-[24px] pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"relative bg-[#080808] group-hover:bg-[#121212] rounded-[23px] px-6 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                                <span class=\"text-sm font-light text-[#EDEDED]/80 tracking-tight\">View Schematics</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-[#EDEDED]/80\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Social Proof -->\n                    <div id=\"hero-logos\" class=\"opacity-0\">\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-light text-neutral-500 mb-5 tracking-widest uppercase\">Trusted by leading platform engineers</p>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8 opacity-80\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-light text-[#EDEDED]/70 text-sm tracking-tight\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" class=\"text-[#EDEDED]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon> Strata\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-light text-[#EDEDED]/70 text-sm tracking-tight\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" class=\"text-[#EDEDED]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon> Vortex\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-light text-[#EDEDED]/70 text-sm tracking-tight\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:globus-linear\" class=\"text-[#EDEDED]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon> Chronos\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Column: WebGL Parallax Module -->\n            <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 p-6 lg:p-12 min-h-[500px] lg:min-h-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <div class=\"relative w-full h-full min-h-[400px] lg:min-h-full p-[1px] group flashlight-module rounded-[24px] bg-neutral-800\">\n\n                    <!-- Flashlight Borders -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] blur-[12px] rounded-[24px] pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] rounded-[24px] pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Inner Content Surface -->\n                    <div class=\"relative bg-[#080808] rounded-[23px] w-full h-full overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center\" id=\"parallax-wrapper\" style=\"perspective: 1000px;\">\n                        <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full transform-gpu\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Technical grid overlay -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(237,237,237,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(237,237,237,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 32px 32px; mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black, transparent 80%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black, transparent 80%);\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // --- 1. Flashlight Glow Effect Directive ---\n        function setupFlashlight() {\n            document.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {\n                document.querySelectorAll('.flashlight-module').forEach(module => {\n                    const rect = module.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    const centerX = rect.left + rect.width / 2;\n                    const centerY = rect.top + rect.height / 2;\n\n                    const dx = e.clientX - centerX;\n                    const dy = e.clientY - centerY;\n\n                    // Calculate cursor angle\n                    let angle = Math.atan2(dy, dx) * (180 / Math.PI) + 90;\n                    module.style.setProperty('--cursor-angle', `${angle}deg`);\n\n                    // Calculate precise edge proximity (peaks at border edge)\n                    const absX = Math.abs(dx);\n                    const absY = Math.abs(dy);\n                    const isInside = absX <= rect.width / 2 && absY <= rect.height / 2;\n\n                    let dist;\n                    if (isInside) {\n                        dist = Math.min(rect.width / 2 - absX, rect.height / 2 - absY);\n                    } else {\n                        const edgeX = Math.max(0, absX - rect.width / 2);\n                        const edgeY = Math.max(0, absY - rect.height / 2);\n                        dist = Math.sqrt(edgeX * edgeX + edgeY * edgeY);\n                    }\n\n                    const maxDist = 150;\n                    const proximity = Math.max(0, 1 - (dist / maxDist));\n                    module.style.setProperty('--proximity', proximity * 100);\n                });\n            });\n        }\n\n        // --- 2. GSAP Masked Reveal Directive ---\n        function setupMaskedReveal() {\n            const heading = document.getElementById('hero-heading');\n            const words = heading.innerText.split(' ');\n            heading.innerHTML = '';\n\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                wrapper.className = 'mask-wrapper inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom mr-[0.25em] pb-[0.1em]';\n\n                const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                inner.className = 'mask-text inline-block';\n                inner.innerText = word;\n\n                wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                heading.appendChild(wrapper);\n            });\n\n            gsap.fromTo('.mask-text',\n                { y: '100%' },\n                {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    duration: 0.3,\n                    ease: 'power3.out',\n                    stagger: 0.05,\n                    delay: 0.2\n                }\n            );\n\n            gsap.to(['#hero-subheading', '#hero-buttons', '#hero-logos'], {\n                opacity: 1,\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 0.3,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                ease: 'power3.out',\n                delay: 0.5,\n                startAt: { y: 15 }\n            });\n        }\n\n        // --- 3. Interactive Parallax Container ---\n        function setupParallax() {\n            const wrapper = document.getElementById('parallax-wrapper');\n            const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n\n            wrapper.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const rect = wrapper.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const xPos = e.clientX - rect.left;\n                const yPos = e.clientY - rect.top;\n\n                const xMove = ((xPos / rect.width) - 0.5) * 20;\n                const yMove = ((yPos / rect.height) - 0.5) * 20;\n                const rotX = ((yPos / rect.height) - 0.5) * 2;\n                const rotY = ((xPos / rect.width) - 0.5) * 2;\n\n                gsap.to(container, {\n                    x: xMove,\n                    y: yMove,\n                    rotationX: -rotX,\n                    rotationY: rotY,\n                    duration: 0.3,\n                    ease: 'power3.out'\n                });\n            });\n\n            wrapper.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                gsap.to(container, {\n                    x: 0,\n                    y: 0,\n                    rotationX: 0,\n                    rotationY: 0,\n                    duration: 0.6,\n                    ease: 'power3.out'\n                });\n            });\n        }\n\n        // --- 4. WebGL Animation (Three.js Isometric Scene) ---\n        function initWebGL() {\n            const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n            const width = container.clientWidth;\n            const height = container.clientHeight;\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            const aspect = width / height;\n            const d = 10;\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-d * aspect, d * aspect, d, -d, 1, 1000);\n            camera.position.set(20, 20, 20);\n            camera.lookAt(scene.position);\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n            renderer.setSize(width, height);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(window.devicePixelRatio);\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Dark Mode Palette Settings Updated\n            const materialColor = 0x080808;\n            const baseEdgeColor = 0x262626;\n            const accentEdgeColor = 0xEDEDED;\n\n            function createOutlinedMesh(geometry, isAccent = false) {\n                const material = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                    color: materialColor,\n                    polygonOffset: true,\n                    polygonOffsetFactor: 1,\n                    polygonOffsetUnits: 1,\n                    transparent: true,\n                    opacity: 0.9\n                });\n                const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n\n                const edges = new THREE.EdgesGeometry(geometry);\n                const lineColor = isAccent ? accentEdgeColor : baseEdgeColor;\n                const line = new THREE.LineSegments(edges, new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: lineColor, linewidth: 1.5 }));\n                mesh.add(line);\n\n                return mesh;\n            }\n\n            const sceneGroup = new THREE.Group();\n            scene.add(sceneGroup);\n\n            // 1. Base Platform\n            const baseGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(12, 0.5, 12);\n            const base = createOutlinedMesh(baseGeo);\n            base.position.y = -2;\n            sceneGroup.add(base);\n\n            // 2. Central Core Architecture\n            const coreOuterGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(6, 4, 0.2);\n            const coreFront = createOutlinedMesh(coreOuterGeo);\n            coreFront.position.set(0, 0, 1.5);\n            coreFront.rotation.x = -0.05;\n\n            const coreBack = createOutlinedMesh(coreOuterGeo);\n            coreBack.position.set(0, 0, -1.5);\n            coreBack.rotation.x = 0.05;\n\n            const folderGroup = new THREE.Group();\n            folderGroup.add(coreFront);\n            folderGroup.add(coreBack);\n            folderGroup.position.y = 0.5;\n            sceneGroup.add(folderGroup);\n\n            // 3. Floating Data Modules\n            const modules = [];\n            const numModules = 4;\n            const moduleGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(2.5, 0.2, 2.5);\n\n            for(let i=0; i<numModules; i++) {\n                const mod = createOutlinedMesh(moduleGeo, true);\n                const angle = (i / (numModules - 1)) * Math.PI - Math.PI/2;\n                const radius = 6;\n\n                mod.userData = {\n                    initialX: Math.sin(angle) * radius,\n                    initialY: 8 + (Math.abs(Math.sin(angle)) * 2),\n                    initialZ: Math.cos(angle) * radius - 2,\n                    phase: i * (Math.PI * 2 / numModules)\n                };\n\n                mod.position.set(mod.userData.initialX, mod.userData.initialY, mod.userData.initialZ);\n                mod.rotation.x = 0.5;\n                mod.rotation.y = angle * 0.5;\n\n                sceneGroup.add(mod);\n                modules.push(mod);\n            }\n\n            // Small decorative floating nodes\n            const decoNodes = [];\n            const decoGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.3, 0.3, 0.3);\n            for(let i=0; i<5; i++) {\n                const node = createOutlinedMesh(decoGeo, true);\n                node.position.set((Math.random()-0.5)*15, (Math.random())*6, (Math.random()-0.5)*15);\n                sceneGroup.add(node);\n                decoNodes.push(node);\n            }\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            let time = 0;\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                time += 0.015;\n\n                sceneGroup.position.y = Math.sin(time * 0.5) * 0.2;\n\n                modules.forEach((mod, i) => {\n                    let progress = (time * 0.15 + mod.userData.phase / (Math.PI * 2)) % 1;\n\n                    const startPos = new THREE.Vector3(mod.userData.initialX, mod.userData.initialY, mod.userData.initialZ);\n                    const endPos = new THREE.Vector3(0, 1, 0);\n\n                    mod.position.lerpVectors(startPos, endPos, Math.pow(progress, 2));\n\n                    if(progress > 0.8) {\n                        const scale = 1 - ((progress - 0.8) * 5);\n                        mod.scale.set(Math.max(scale,0), Math.max(scale,0), Math.max(scale,0));\n                    } else {\n                        mod.scale.set(1,1,1);\n                    }\n\n                    if(progress < 0.1) {\n                         mod.position.y += Math.sin(time * 2 + i) * 0.1;\n                    }\n                });\n\n                decoNodes.forEach((node, i) => {\n                    node.rotation.x += 0.01;\n                    node.rotation.y += 0.01;\n                    node.position.y += Math.sin(time + i) * 0.005;\n                });\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                const newWidth = container.clientWidth;\n                const newHeight = container.clientHeight;\n                const newAspect = newWidth / newHeight;\n\n                camera.left = -d * newAspect;\n                camera.right = d * newAspect;\n                camera.top = d;\n                camera.bottom = -d;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n\n                renderer.setSize(newWidth, newHeight);\n            });\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            setupFlashlight();\n            setupMaskedReveal();\n            setupParallax();\n            setTimeout(initWebGL, 100);\n        });\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-autonomous-scaling-infrastructure.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-autonomous-scaling-infrastructure.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-autonomous-scaling-infrastructure-DESIGN.md", "views": 98, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T14:31:17.028858+00:00"}